{
  "day": 3,
  "beats": {
    "boot": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Still raining. Working from home anyway; let it."
        }
      ]
    },
    "rise": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You have been sitting a while before you notice: the glass has been moved. One finger's width."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Could have been me."
        }
      ]
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Done. You walk once round the room, desk to bed, bed to window.",
          "where": "room"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "At the foot of the bed there is something extra under your foot.",
          "where": "room"
        }
      ]
    },
    "shutdown": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "屏幕",
          "t": "I made that for you, not for them.",
          "where": "screen"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It did not answer what I asked. It answered something else.",
          "where": "screen"
        }
      ]
    },
    "night": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A point of light on the desk, flat against the surface, under the gap, on and off."
        },
        {
          "k": "sfx",
          "t": "Beep.",
          "sfx": "chick-beep"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "One beep, short and thin, like the one under the blanket many years ago."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "It has no battery. You know that."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You close your eyes. Something in your hand, a black shell, a little smaller than your palm."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The last term of primary school. Evening; your father comes home from work, unclips the pager from his belt and puts it in your hand.",
          "backdrop": "/room/dream/home_dinner.jpg"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "father",
          "t": "Go on, play. Not that key."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You press the other keys. The screen scrolls back a line at a time, all digits, all for him."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Dinner. Don't break it."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "father",
          "t": "Can't break it. It just takes numbers."
        },
        {
          "k": "sfx",
          "t": "Bzzz.",
          "sfx": "pager-buzz"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "寻呼机",
          "t": "3306"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A string of digits, out of nowhere. You hold it up, and before you've said a word his hand is already out."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "father",
          "t": "Give it here."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "One look. Chopsticks down, keys picked up."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "father",
          "t": "I'll go down and make a call."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Come back up and eat after."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "There was a payphone at the shop downstairs. Sometimes he made the call and came back up, the food still warm. Sometimes he made the call and walked straight out from there."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Go to sleep. Your dad's not coming home tonight."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "What those digits said, I never once understood. It only receives. Who is on the other end, it doesn't say."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Usually I keep one dream. Tonight I kept two."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The second has no story to tell. The sky is very low, almost on the ground. Between sky and ground only a thin layer is left, as high as my ceiling."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "By the pillow something breathes, giggles, winds past, gallops past, makes no sound."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The loose one in the case. A pager, black shell, the belt clip half snapped off."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The battery bay is empty. A little green rust on the two spring contacts."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It is lighter than I thought."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
